    "gated_on_by_yaml": "Opt-like or randomize_* / mode flags that are TRUE (or non-default-on) in demo_dynamic.yml so yaml-alone runs get them without GUI Opt selection. GUI Default may still force these OFF.",
    "note": "Global domain_randomization in demo_dynamic.yml is all off (random_background/light/clutter false; table/camera jitter 0) — omitted from per-task lists."
